  "title": "Lumentum Named to Newsweek’s America’s Greatest Workplaces in Tech 2026",
  "summary": "SAN JOSE, Calif., June 20, 2026 — Lumentum Holdings Inc. (\" Lumentum \") today announced it has been named one of America’s Greatest Workplaces in Tech 2026 by Newsweek and Plant-A Insights Group. Based on an evaluation of publicly available data and a confidential nationwide employee survey, the recognition highlights organizations that prioritize employee well-being, strong leadership, fair compensation, and work-life balance. This is the second consecutive year that t",
